# Unit Tests (Vitest)

- Use in-memory Mongo via `tests/setup.js` + `mongodb-memory-server` (do not require local mongod).
- Alias **one** mongoose in `vitest.config.js` to `Server/node_modules/mongoose`. Dual mongoose copies cause buffering timeouts and silent disconnects.
- `fileParallelism: false`, high `hookTimeout` for MMS startup.
- Exclude Playwright e2e from Vitest (`tests/e2e/**`).
- Fix broken connect blocks; prefer `connectTestDB` / setup URI over hard-coded localhost.
- Align fixtures with schemas (`uid` required on Group, etc.) and controller APIs (`_id`, `group_id`, …).
- Mock async background runners in controller tests so `beforeEach` `deleteMany` cannot race live jobs.
- Constructable model mocks for importers (`new Interface()` + `findOne`), not plain `{ findOne }` objects.
